	(lib_symbols)
	(text "FT232HL (blocks/4-usb.md), powered per DS Fig. 6.2 (VCCD makes FT_3V3)\n93LC56B EEPROM (2.2 k DO-DI, 10 k DO up), 12 MHz crystal + 15 pF, REF 12 k, VPHY/VPLL ferrites,\nRESET# 10 k/10 nF, WR#/SIWU# 10 k pull-ups, decoupling. FT_D4-7/FT_WR_N reach the RP2350 only\nthrough unfitted 0 Ω links (FIFO rework)."
